== Effects ==
* {{dlc|nr+}} Spawns 3 [[Blue Fly|Blue Flies]] and 3 [[Blue Spider]]s.
* {{dlc+|r+}} Gives Isaac 3 standard {{i|Abyss}} locusts for the room.{{dlc-}}

== Synergies ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth|nr}}: Spawns 6 Blue Flies and 6 Blue Spiders.
* {{t|Fish Tail|nr+}}: Doubles the flies and spiders spawned.
* {{i|BFFS!|r+}} / {{i|Hive Mind}}: Increases the locusts' size and damage by 25%.
** These two items don't stack.
* {{t|Extension Cord|r+}}: Electricity will flow between Isaac and the locusts.
* {{i|Ipecac|r+}}: Locusts gain a flat +2 damage.
* {{i|Sacrificial Altar}}: Locust summoned for the room can be sacrificed as regular {{i|Abyss}} locust, allowing to use the item even if no familiars have been yet obtained.

== Interactions ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth|r}}: No effect.

